<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">1Tasolonqe Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Tasolonqe Asaas Xaafida Koyro Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Tasolonqe Asaas</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Taso</para>
  <para style="mt2">Phawuloosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tasolonqe Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Koyro Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Tasolonqey Maqidooniya geetettiza Oroomes waanna katama. Phawuloosi Tasolonqe Woosa Keeththayo essiday Piliphisiyoose yeggi bidaappe guyenna. Heerakka issi agina kumontta dishin Ayhudati izi Piliphisiyoose yeggi bidayssa siyida; hessa gishshas Phawuloosi isttas xaafida ba kiitazan Mishiraachcho qaalaa qaanththara qonccisides. (1:9-10) Isttika Ayhudata ammano ekkanaas mati uttida Ayzaabeti Phawuloosi yootiza ammanon wozina boshettida. Hessa gishshas Ayhudati qanaateteththan Phawuloosa bolla palama denththida; hessa gishshas Phawuloosi Tasolonqe yeggidi gede Beeriya baanayssi izas manne gidides. Guuth gam7ishe Qorontoose katama bi gakkida mala Ximtoosi Woosa Keeththay hanizayssa wursika izas yootides.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi koyro kiitaa Tasolonqe asaas xaafiday ammanizayta denththeththanaassinne minththeththanaassa; izi istta lo7o ammano gishshassinne istta siiqoteththaa gishshas lo7o wore siyidi Xoos galatides. Kase Phawuloosi isttara diza wode izi isttara ay mala duus de7idaakko istta qofsees; hessafekka Kirstoosas nam7anththo yuussaa gishshas dendida oyshatas zaaro immees.</para>
  <para style="ip">He oyshatappe baggayti, «Kirstoosi haa simmi yaanaappe kasetidi kase hayqqida ammaniza asay Kirstoosa yuussaan beettiza mernaa de7o demmanee?» gizayta. Phawuloosikka hessa gaaso histtidi, «Kirstoosas nam7anththo yuussa timirteza hidotan naagishe he wode gakkanaas co7u giidi intte ooso ooththite» giidi istta zorees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geloso <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1:1</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa ufayssinne iza galata <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1:2—3:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniza asay kaallana woga <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kirstoosi nam7anththo yaana yuussaa gishshas imettida timirte <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4:13—5:11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurseththa zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-22">5:12-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:23-28">5:23-28</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Phawuloosappe, Silwaanoosappenne Ximtoosappe; Xoossaa Aawassinne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosayta gidida Tasolonqen diza ammaniza asaas nu Aawaa Xoossaafenne Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa kiyateththinne saroteththi inttes gido.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Hawa 17:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tasolonqen Ammaniza Asaa Ammano Gishshas Shiiqida Galata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Nu inttena nu woosan qoppishe ubba wode Xoossaa intte gishshas galatoos. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Ammanoninne mino siiqoteththan intte ooththida ooso gishshas Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa bolla diza intte mino hidotan beettida intte minoteththaa gishshas nu Godaa Xoossaa, nu Aawaa sinththan ubba gallas intte gishshas qoppoos.<verse eid="1TH 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Xoossan dosettida nu ishatoo! Izi inttena dooridayssa nu eroos. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Gaasoykka Mishiraachcho qaalay intteko yiday wolqqara Xillo Ayananinne lo7eththi shaakki eriin attiin coo qaala xallan gidenna; qasseka nu intte gishshas giidi waani de7idaakko intte ereeta. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Ha7i intte nunanne Godaa misatideta; intte bolla ay metoy gakkidaa gidikkoka Xillo Ayana ufayssan qaalaa intte ekkideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5-9">Hawa 1:5-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Hessafe dendidayssan intte Maqidooniyaninne Akayan ammaniza asa ubbaas lo7o leemisota gidideta. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Godaa qaalay inttefe kezidi Maqidooniyaninne Akayan siyeteth xalla gidontta inttes Xoossa bolla diza ammanoy ubbason erettides; hessa gishshas nu inttes yootanaas aykkoka koshshenna. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Intte nuna wostti mokki ekkidaakkonne de7on diza tumu Xoossaas ooththanaas intte eeqatappe Xoossaako waani simmidaakko asay intte gishshas haasayees. <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>Qasseka Xoossi hayqoppe denththidayssa buro yaana hanqofe nuna ashshana Saloppe yaana Xoossa Naa Yesusa yuussaa intte wostti naagizaakko asay haasayees.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Tasolonqen Phawuloosa Ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Nu ishatoo! Nu inttekon gam7ida gam7oy hada gidonttayssa intteka ereeta. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Intteka erizayssa mala hayssafe kase Piliphisiyoosen nu waayenne meto be7idossinne cayettidos; gido attiin aynne mino waayey nuna gakkikokka Xoossa Mishiraachcho qaalaa inttes yootanaas nu Godaappe xalateth demmidos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Hawa 16:19-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17:1-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Nu inttena zorida zorey iita qofara woykko inttena baleththanaas koyidi gidenna. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Gido attiin nu Mishiraachcho qaalaa hadara ekkanaas dandayza asata mala Xoossi nuna qoodida gishshas nu haasayoos; hessaka nu ooththizay nu wozina paacci eriza Xoossaa ufayssanaas attiin as ufayssanaas giidi gidenna. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Nu mulekka baleththo qaala yootibeekko woykko nu uuzeteth kammanaas giidi baleththo hano nu hanonttayssa intte ereeta; hayssaska nu markkay Xoossa.<verse eid="1TH 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Inttefe gidiin woykko haratappe oonappeka asappe imettiza bonchcho nu koyibeekko. <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>Nu Kirstoosi kiittidayta gidida gishshas inttes tooho gidanaas dandayoos; gido attiin aaya ba nayta dichchiza mala nunikka intte giddon ashketeththan simerettidos. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Xoossa qaala xalla gidontta dishin nu shemppoka intte gishshas ufayssan immana gakkanaas inttena siiqidos; gaasoykka nu inttena daro siiqida gishshassa. <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Nu ishatoo! Nu dafeteththaanne nu daaburaa intte ereeta; oonaska tooho gidontta mala qammanne gallas nuus ooththishe Mishiraachcho qaalaa inttes yootidos.<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Nu inttenara ammanizaytara diza wode xilloteththaninne geeshshateththan qasseka wosoy baynda nu waani de7idaakko intteka Xoossika nuus markka. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Aaway ba naytas haniza mala nunikka inttes issaas issaas ay hanidaakko intte ereeta. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Intte inttena ba kawoteththassinne ba bonchchos xeygida Xoossaas bessiza mala intte daana mala nu inttena minththidos; lo7eththi zoridossinne hadara gidos.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Intte nuuppe siyida Xoossa qaalaa ekkida wode ammaniza intte achchan tumu ooththiza Xoossa qaalaa mala ekkideta attiin coo asa qaala mala intte ekkontta aggida gishshas nuni Xoossaa qanxxoy baynda galatoos.<verse eid="1TH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Nu ishatoo! Yuhuda biittan Yesus Kirstoosa ammaniza Xoossa Woosa Keeththata misatideta; istti Ayhudatappe metonne waaye ekkida mala intteka intte asaappe waaye ekkideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Hawa 17:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>Istti Godaa Yesusanne kase nabetakka wodhida; nunakka gooddida; Xoossaaka ufayssibeettenna; as ubbaara eqettizayta gidida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Hawa 9:23</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13:45</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14:2</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:5">17:5</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:12">18:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Hessika Ayzaabeti siyidi attana qaala nu isttas yootontta mala digganaassa; hessa mala ooson ba nagara ubba wode ba bolla wurseth gakkanaas gujji gujji beettes; Xoossa hanqoyka istta bolla wodhdhides.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Tasolonqe Asaa Beyanaas Laamoteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Gidikkoka nu ishatoo! Nu guuththa wodes inttefe Ayanan gidontta ashon shaakettikokka intte laamotay nuna wodhiza gishshas intte ayfeso beyanaas daro dafeteththan doos. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Nu intteko baanaas daro laamotidos shin harappeka ta Phawuloosi daro wode dafettadis shin Xala7ey nuna diggides. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Godaa Yesusi haa yiza wode iza sinththan nu hidotay woykko nu ufayssi woykko nu zawudey nuus inttefe haray oonee? <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Tumappeka nu ufayssinne nu bonchchoy inttena.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Hessa gishshas nuus dandayettontta ixxiin he wode Ateenan nurkka nu attanayssi nuus lo7o gidi beettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15">Hawa 17:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>Inttena ammanon minththana mala nunara asas Kirstoosa mishiraachcho qaalaa yootiza Xoossa ashkara gidida Ximtoosa intteko yeddidos. <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>Hessika hayssa paacezan oonikka ammanoppe qanxxontta malassa; nunikka hayssas doorettidayssa intteka ereeta. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Nu qasse inttenara diza wode waayey nu bolla gakkanayssa kasetidi inttes yootidos; intte eriza malakka hanides. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Hessa gishshas ta aykkoka genceciin taas dandayettontta ixxida gishshas intte ammano gishshas eranaas gaada Ximtoosa kiittadis; ta hessa ooththiday oonee erizay paaccizaadey istta paacciin hanni wode nu daaburay wurikka hada gidontta aggenna gaada babbida gishshassa.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ximtoosi Ekki Yida Minththeththiza Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Ha7i qasse Ximtoosi intte achchafe nuukko yiidi intte ammano gishshassinne intte siiqoteththaa gishshas lo7o wore nuna sissides. Qasseka intte ubba wode nuna lo7eththi qoppizayssanne nunikka inttena beyanaas laamotiza mala intteka nuna beyanaas laamotizayssa nuus yootides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Hawa 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Hessa gishshas nu ishatoo! Nu dizay waayeninne meto garsan gidikkoka intte ammano gaason inttenan ha7i nu minettoos. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Intte Godaan minni eqqida gishshas tumappe ha7i nu paxa daana. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Intte gaason nu Xoossa sinththan nu demmida ubba ufayssaa gishshas Xoossa ay mala galatanaas dandayzonii? <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Qasseka nu inttena beyanaassinne intte ammanoppe paccidayssa kunththanaas omarsinne gallas keehi woossoos.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Ha7ikka nu intteko baana mala nu Aaway Xoossi Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi ogeza izi nuus suuriso. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Nu inttena siiqiza mala inttes intte garsan diza siiqonne intte harata siiqiza siiqoza Goday darsonne keehi gujjo. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi geeshshata ubbatara yiza wode nu Aawaa Godaa Xoossaa sinththan intte wosoy bayndaytanne geeshshata gididi beettana mala intte wozina izi minththo.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoos Ufayssiza Duus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Ha7i wurseththan ta ishatoo! Intte Xoossa ufayssanaas intte waani waani daana bessizaakko nu inttena tamaarsidos; tumappeka nu tamaarsida mala deeta; hessa gishshas Godaa Yesus Kirstoosan nu inttena woossizaynne zorizay hayssafekka aadhdhiza hanora intte sinththe gujjana malassa. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa wolqqan nu inttes ay azazo immidaakko intte ereeta.<verse eid="1TH 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Xoossa sheney intte laymappe haakkidi dummatanaassa. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Qasse issi issi asay ba machcho geeshshateththaninne bonchchon ayso bessizayssa shaakki ero. <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>Hessika Xoos ammanontta Ayzaabeta mala layma qaaqqateththan gidoppo. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Hessa malan oonikka balettidi ba ishaa baleththofo; gaasoykka hayssafe kase nu inttes yootida malanne naagettanaas akeekissida mala Goday heytantta mala nagara ooththiza ubbata bolla ba hanqo ehana. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Xoossi nuna geeshshateththas xeygides attiin tunateththas xeygibeenna. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Hessa gishshas hayssa ha zoreza kadhidi ekkonttaadey Xillo Ayana izas immida Xoossaa kadhees attiin as kadhizaade gidenna.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Ishata siiqoteththa gishshas inttes oonikka xaafanaas koshshenna; gaasoykka intte intte giddon siiqettana mala intte intte baggara Xoossafe tamaardeta. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Kumeththa Maqidooniyan diza ammaniza asaa intte ubbaa siiqizayssi erettidayssa; gido attiin nu ishatoo! Sinththa baggan intte hayssafe aaththi siiqettana mala nu inttena zoroos. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Nu hayssafe kase inttena azazida mala intte intte kushera ooththite; woppu gi diite; inttes gidizayssa lo7eththi xeellite. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Hessika gallas gallas intte duussay hankko ammanontta asaa achchan inttena bonchchisana malanne intte ay asaska tooho gidontta malassa.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaas Nam7anththo Yuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Ta ishatoo! Intte ashon hayqqidayta gishshas tumaa erana mala nu koyokko; qasseka hidotay baynda hara asata mala intte kayottana mala nu koyokko. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Yesusi hayqqidi dendidayssa nu ammanizaa gidikko Yesusa ammanidayta Xoossi Yesusara hessaththoka zaari haa yeddana.<verse eid="1TH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Nu Godaa qaalan inttes gizay hayssa; nuni hayqqontta paxa dizaytinne Goday yaana gakkanaas gam7anayti kase hayqqidaytappe sinththatokko. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Goday ba hu7era gita azazon kiitanchchata halaqa giirissara Xoossa xurumba giirissan saloppe wodhdhana; kase Kirstoosa ammanidi hayqqidayti istti kaseti dendana. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Hessafe guye nuni qasse paxa dizayti Godaa carko bolla gaagganaas isttara issife shaarara dendana; hessaththoka nu mernaas Godaara daana. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Hessa gishshas ha qaalaan issoy issaara minettite.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Ta ishatoo! Hessi hanana wodeza gishshas nu inttes xaafanaas koshshenna. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Kaysoy qamman yiza mala Godaa gallassika hessa mala yaanayssa intte intte baggara lo7eththi ereeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mato 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luqa 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2Phex 3:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Asay, «Gadey saronne lo7okko» gishin miixay qanththara diza maccas oykkiza mala hessaththoka as dhayssizay qoppontta dishin asa bolla gakkana; oonikka kessi ekkenna.<verse eid="1TH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Intteno ishatoo! He gallassay kayso mala inttena daganththanaas intte dhuman deekketa. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Intte wurikka poo7o nayta; nuni dhuma woykko qamma baggata gidokko. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Histtiko ane beeggoos; ane nurkka nuna haaroos attiin hankko dhiskiza asaa mala nunikka ane dhiskokko. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Dhiskizayti qammara dhiskeettes; maththottizaytikka qammara maththotteettes. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Nuni gidikko gallassa asata gidida gishshas ammanonne siiqo, tiran may7iza xurure may7o mala may7idi atoteththa hidota hu7en woththiza birata qoobe mala hu7en woththidi ane nunateththaa haaridi de7oos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Efe 6:13-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Xoossi nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa baggara atoteth demmana mala attiin nuna hanqos xeygibeenna. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Nu hayqqikokka woykko paxa diikkoka izara daana mala izi nu gishshas hayqqides. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Hessa gishshas tumappe intte ha7i ooththizayssa malakka issoy issaara minettitenne minththeththite.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurseththa Zorenne Saroka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Histtiko ta ishatoo! Intte giddon minni ooththizayta Godaan inttefe bollara diza halaqatanne inttena zorizayta intte bonchchana mala nu inttena woossoos. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Istta ooso gishshassika istta siiqora lo7eththi bonchchite; intte intte giddon saron diite.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Ta ishatoo! Nu inttena, «Ooso ooththontta asata hanqettite; babbizayta minththite; daaburanchchata maaddite; as ubbaa dandayte» gi zoroos. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Oonaska iita gishshas iita zaarontta mala naagettite; gido attiin intte intte giddon gidiin hara asara gidiin ubba wode lo7o gidizayssa ooththanaas baaxetite.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Ubba wode ufayettite. <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>Qanxxontta woossite. <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>Ay hanonkka galatite; Xoossa sheney inttes Yesus Kirstoosa baggara hessa.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Xillo Ayana tama toyssofte. <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Tinbite qaala kadhopite. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Wursika paacci xeellite; lo7o gididaaz oykkite. <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>Iita gidida ay miishshafekka haakkite.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Saroteththa Goday izi ubba miishshan inttena dummaso; intte ayanay, intte shemppoynne intte ashoy Godaa Yesus Kirstoosi yiza wode wosoy baynda naagetto. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Inttena xeygidayssi ammanettidaade gidida gishshas izi hessa ooththana.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Nu ishatoo! Nu gishshassika woossite. <verse eid="1TH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Ammanizayta ubbaa geeshsha yeereteththan sarokkite. <verse eid="1TH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Ha kiitay ammanizaytas ubbaas nababettana mala Godaa sunththan hadara gays.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Nu Godaa Yesus Kirstoosa aadho kiyateththi inttenara gido.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
